        )
    },
    1980: {
        'title': '1980s — Boom, Bust & Stabilization',
        'text': (
            f'Average price: <strong>${decades[decades["Decade"]==1980]["Avg_Price"].values[0]:.2f}</strong>/bbl. '
            f'The decade opened near crisis-era highs (~${df[(df["Decade"]==1980) & (df["Year"]==1980)]["Price"].max():.2f}) '
            f'before the 1986 price collapse sent crude below ${df[df["Decade"]==1980]["Price"].min():.2f}. '
            f'OPEC\'s quota discipline crumbled, and Saudi Arabia abandoned its swing-producer role, flooding the market. '
            f'By the late 1980s, prices stabilized around $15–20/bbl — a new equilibrium that would define the next era.'
        )
    },
    1990: {
        'title': '1990s — Low & Stable Prices',
        'text': (
            f'The most placid decade on record. Average price: <strong>${decades[decades["Decade"]==1990]["Avg_Price"].values[0]:.2f}</strong>/bbl '
            f'with a standard deviation of just ${decades[decades["Decade"]==1990]["Std_Dev"].values[0]:.2f}. '
            f'The 1990 Gulf War caused a brief spike to ${df[df["Decade"]==1990]["Price"].max():.2f}, but prices quickly retreated. '
